[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4347676010","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118824#issuecomment-4347676010","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118824","id":4347676010,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAyRFag","user":{"login":"Chaosed0","id":2808430,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4MDg0MzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2808430?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0","html_url":"https://github.com/Chaosed0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chaosed0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-29T21:36:03Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T19:29:27Z","body":"I've been working with hpvb in RocketChat to test this PR. Just tested the latest iteration on both the MRP and our real project, and things generally seem to be working as expected now.\r\n\r\nEDIT: Ran into a deadlock with the latest changes. We're working in the chat to resolve it.\r\nEDIT 2: Looks like the deadlock is fixed 🎉 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4347676010/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4357105922","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118824#issuecomment-4357105922","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118824","id":4357105922,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA7QpAg","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-01T00:34:57Z","updated_at":"2026-05-01T00:36:22Z","body":"I believe this PR is ready for merging now.\r\n\r\nI can't think of anything this might regress. \r\n\r\n* When not using the thread pool we are at threadindex -1 and nothing changes.\r\n* If we are in the thread pool, we now wait in all circumstances except for when we would wait on ourselves.\r\n* If we run more than once we avoid the use after free of the parent task by only handing off \"changed\" the first time, when we are sure parent is still valid\r\n* We now increment the refcount on the token when the user requests one so we keep it alive long enough\r\n* In my benchmarks it doesn't seem to negatively affect single threaded or uncontested multi threaded loads\r\n* In contested loads it seems that waiting is faster than doing the same load over and over, I'm assuming that is because multiple threads trying to load the same resource ends up hammering a bunch of locks?\r\n\r\nI might have missed something of course! But at least I'm pretty sure this solves all of the things I can think of 😅 ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4357105922/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4358404142","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118824#issuecomment-4358404142","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118824","id":4358404142,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABA8f4Lg","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-01T07:55:26Z","updated_at":"2026-05-01T07:55:26Z","body":"Happy to report and confirm that this fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118185 as well!","auth