x99x","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-18T21:07:03Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T21:07:03Z","body":"> > Unfortunately I'm seeing **very common** deadlocks in `load_threaded_get()` after upgrading from 4.6.stable to 4.7.beta2. Details in [#119371](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119371#issuecomment-4456922040). This is on a large project (~4GB), but if it's helpful, I can share it privately.\r\n> \r\n> A private share of the project would be very helpful! Thank you.\r\n\r\nThanks! I've shared the project with the tmm.cx email listed on your profile. The easiest way to repro the issue is to load it in the editor, launch normally (F5), then click Quit right in the main menu. On 4.7.beta2 this results in an almost guaranteed deadlock. On 4.6.stable, it doesn't, but often randomly crashes on start within `load_threaded_get()` as described in #119371. If you want to see the `ResourceLoader` calls, they all go though `utils/async_loaded_resource.gd` and `utils/async_loaded_group.gd`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4482218049/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4486731503","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118824#issuecomment-4486731503","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118824","id":4486731503,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC24W7w","user":{"login":"max99x","id":680351,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MDM1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/680351?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x","html_url":"https://github.com/max99x","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/max99x/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T10:15:42Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T10:15:42Z","body":"Dug into it a bit. The crash reported in #119371 is fixed by the part of this CL that adds the `connections_propagated` check. With just that everything seems to work fine on my side. If you end up reverting this, it is worth keeping that fix if it doesn't depend on the rest of the changes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4486731503/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4492122672","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118824#issuecomment-4492122672","issue_ur